<title>FRANCE: Rouen May 1-21 grain exports at 408,396 tns.</title>
<headline>Rouen May 1-21 grain exports at 408,396 tns.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 408,396 tonnes between May 1 and May 21, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports were 174,000 tonnes for the whole of May 1996.</p>
<p>The May 1-21 grain total included 287,546 tonnes of wheat and 120,850 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   49,125</p>
<p>    Algeria			 22,700</p>
<p>    Britain			 11,540</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,650</p>
<p>    Italy			  173,531</p>
<p>    Portugal			 3,300</p>
<p>    Reunion Island		 3,000</p>
<p>    Turkey			  22,700</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    South Africa		  24,800</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		  59,700</p>
<p>    Greece			   3,000</p>
<p>    Italy			    2,350</p>
<p>    Tunisia			 25,000</p>
<p>    Turkey			   6,000</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
